<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S5.SS2" title="In V EXPERIMENT and RESULTS ‣ VisioPath: Vision-Language Enhanced Model Predictive Control for Safe Autonomous Navigation in Mixed Traffic" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref"><span class="ltx_text">V-B</span> </span><span class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Vision-Based Initial Trajectory Generation</span></span></a></li>
